<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Vengeance, 2021</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt; 
&lt;P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;Vengeance, 2022&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;Al "Beirutdude" Sandrik&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;The Time Is: 4 June, 2022, &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;06:00 Zulu/08:00 Beirut Time&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;Playable as Israel Only&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;1 Days 6 Hours Duration &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;Background: &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal"&gt;The tit for tat naval war between Iran and Israel continued through 2021 and the Spring of 2022. The attack on the Israeli MV Saviz on July 29th, 2021 proved to the first lethal assault on each other’s merchant vessels. The crescendo occurred on the moonless night of May 30th, 2022 when the Israeli merchant Zim Naples was attacked while transiting the Sea of Oman. Rockets struck her bridge killing and maiming the watch standers there. Two patrol boats came alongside in the dark with black clad boarders stealthily scaling her hull. Quickly and efficiently the remaining crew was rounded up and hustled to the transom, where they were bound and beheaded. Videos of the attack were uploaded to Youtube within an hour and broadcast to worldwide revulsion. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;Mossad quickly ascertained the Iranian sponsored Brotherhood of the Islamic Jihad was responsible for the attack and the Israeli cabinet decided the time for a direct strike on an Iranian warship had come. They decided it was important to send a decisive message but also maintain a level of “plausible deniability.” Thus, it was decided the IDF Submarine INS Rahav would launch the attack but Israeli recon assets would be limited to covert surveillance operations, the new ELM-2270 OTH Radars&amp;nbsp;and normal satellite data. &lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;An Iranian task group of three vessels had transited the Suez Canal on June 1st and was conducting a “Good Will Tour” in Port Said, Egypt. Mossad dispatched agents to that port to keep watch on the vessels and other Mossad agents boarded a sailboat and fishing boats to intercept the task force as it made its way to the Syrian port of Latakia.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;On the night of the 3rd the Russian frigate Admiral Essen arrived off the Suez Canal, but did not enter Port Said. Russian President Putin announced the vessel would “accompany” the Iranians in their passage to Syria the next day. He was especially ambiguous as to whether the frigate was there to defend or simply escort the Iranian task force. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;Unfortunately, one of the Mossad “boats” had to return to Haifa with an engineering causality, leaving incomplete surveillance assets to monitor the Iranian passage. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;Mission: &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal"&gt;As commander of the Israeli Submarine Rahav you are tasked with using your torpedoes to sink at least one Iranian vessel. In order to maintain a level of deniability you may NOT use your Harpoon missiles (and your “Popeye” nukes have been removed). Obviously, you may NOT attack the Russian vessel.&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal"&gt;Good Hunting. &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;Notes:&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;This is just a small little scenario that should play very fast with limited units and options. The trick is finding the right place to engage the Iranians with limited intelligence available. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;Make sure Pop up Messages are enabled. &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;Scoring: &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;-1,000 points = Disaster and 1,000 a Triumph&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: "MS Mincho"; mso-bidi-font-family: "MS Mincho"'&gt;　&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;Built under C:MO Build 1147.30 Database DB3000 v489&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;A Delta File is provided for deep rebuilds.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;Al "BeirutDude" Sandrik (ex-Beachinnole)&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;Al.Sandrik@gmail.com&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=left&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
